# Session fixtures + recorder

- Curated packs live in **`tests/sessions/<slug>/`** (`session.json`, `expectations.json`, `meta.json`, optional `trace.json` / `assets/`).
- Capture with `npm run session:capture-fixture` (not a full `.data` dump). Prefer allowlisted assets only.
- Domain tests use `loadSessionFixture(slug)` and **concrete** `expectations.json` values.
- Playwright: `npm run test:e2e`; seed only against localhost. Prod `PLAYWRIGHT_BASE_URL` is read-only.
- Recorder: app-wide `SessionRecorderHost`, gated by `SESSION_RECORDER_ENABLED` (dev on by default). UI Start/Stop; `R` toggles panel visibility; listeners only while recording. Export `trace.json` into the pack; convert to e2e specs (see `docs/session-fixture-recorder.md`).
